{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:4141-1","published":"2026-09-14T07:58:58Z","modified":"2026-09-28T18:23:12.648589568Z","related":["CVE-2026-18917","CVE-2026-61477","CVE-2026-63622","CVE-2026-63623","CVE-2026-77159"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-18917","CVE-2026-61477","CVE-2026-63622","CVE-2026-63623","CVE-2026-77159"],"summary":"Security update for libvirt","details":"This update for libvirt fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-18917: Integer overflow in NodeGetFreePages RPC handler leading to heap buffer overflow (bsc#1275863).\n- CVE-2026-61477: newline injection in network XML DNS TXT/SRV fields allows dnsmasq config directive injection\n  (bsc#1274576).\n- CVE-2026-63622: `swtpm` privilege escalation via symlink following (bsc#1275264).\n- CVE-2026-63623: information disclosure via world-readable storage volume images during clone/convert (bsc#1275265).\n- CVE-2026-77159: root `chown()` on `swtpm` logfile follows symlinks (bsc#1274946).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libvirt","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server 12 SP5-LTSS","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/libvirt&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%2012%20SP5-LTSS"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"5.1.0-13.48.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libvirt":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-admin":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-client":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-config-network":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-config-nwfilter":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-interface":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-libxl":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-lxc":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-network":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-nodedev":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-nwfilter":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-qemu":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-secret":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-storage":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-storage-core":"5.1.0-13.48.1","libvirt-daemon-driver-